    "year": "2017",
    "board": "Dhaka",
    "question": "<p>কোন সমীকরণের একটি মূল $1-i\\sqrt 2$ হলে, সমীকরণটি হবে-</p>",
    "options": [
      "$x^2-2x+3=0$",
      "$x^2+2x+3=0$",
      "$x^2-3x+2=0$",
      "$x^2+3x+2=0$"
    ],
    "answer": "$x^2-2x+3=0$",
    "explanation": "<p>$\\alpha=1-i\\sqrt2$</p><p>$\\beta=1+i\\sqrt2$</p><p>$\\therefore$ সমীকরণটি হবে, $x^2-(\\alpha+\\beta) x+\\alpha \\beta=0$</p><p>বা,$x^2-\\left(1-i\\sqrt2+1+i\\sqrt2\\right)x+\\left(1-i\\sqrt2\\right)\\left(1+i\\sqrt2\\right)=0$</p><p>বা,$x^2-2x+3=0$</p>"
  },
